    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d20">

                <pb facs="0086" n="12" xml:id="pg12"/>

                <head>Mr. Burnley to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-12-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 15, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Sir:</hi> This is what the governor general
                    telegraphed last night:</p>
                <p>“The St. Albans men were discharged yesterday, on grounds so absurd that I cannot
                    account for it. Fresh warrants have been issued for their apprehension, and the
                    police are making every effort to prevent their escape.”</p>
                <p>Very truly yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. HUME BURNLEY.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
